<title>UK: Argent sells retail park to Scottish Widows.</title>
<headline>Argent sells retail park to Scottish Widows.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Property firm Argent Group Plc said on Thursday that it has sold a retail park in England to mutually-owned life insurer Scottish Widows for 29.5 million stg.  </p>
<p>Argent said that the sale price of the Mayflower retail park, situated in Basildon, southern England, represents a premium to book value.</p>
<p>This is the first retail park purchased by Scottish Widows and reflects their strategy of building a holding in this sector.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
